 "turns": [
  {
   "index": 0,
   "speaker": "Brooke",
   "text": "Okay, let's go. We're at ninety-nine and a half crash-free, we hit the target, so readiness is a yes.",
   "agenda_item": "readiness",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [
    "E001"
   ],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 1,
   "speaker": "Ian",
   "text": "We're at ninety-eight point seven. The target is ninety-nine five. We haven't hit it.",
   "agenda_item": "readiness",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [
    "E002",
    "E003"
   ],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 2,
   "speaker": "Brooke",
   "text": "Ninety-eight seven, ninety-nine five. That's a rounding difference.",
   "agenda_item": "readiness",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [
    "E004",
    "E005"
   ],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 3,
   "speaker": "Ian",
   "text": "It's twice as many crashes. On a workout app, a crash mid-workout is a one-star review.",
   "agenda_item": "readiness",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 4,
   "speaker": "Arturo",
   "text": "Users don't care about decimals, Ian.",
   "agenda_item": "readiness",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 5,
   "speaker": "Ian",
   "text": "They care when the timer resets in the middle of a sprint interval.",
   "agenda_item": "readiness",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 6,
   "speaker": "Nadine",
   "text": "Where are the crashes?",
   "agenda_item": "readiness",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [
    "E006"
   ],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 7,
   "speaker": "Ian",
   "text": "The new video player on older Android phones. We have a fix in testing.",
   "agenda_item": "readiness",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 8,
   "speaker": "Brooke",
   "text": "When does the fix ship?",
   "agenda_item": "readiness",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [
    "E007"
   ],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 9,
   "speaker": "Ian",
   "text": "If testing goes well, the thirtieth.",
   "agenda_item": "readiness",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 10,
   "speaker": "Brooke",
   "text": "Then readiness is a yes, pending the thirtieth.",
   "agenda_item": "readiness",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [
    "E008"
   ],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 11,
   "speaker": "Ian",
   "text": "Pending. That's not a yes.",
   "agenda_item": "readiness",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 12,
   "speaker": "Brooke",
   "text": "Billing. Ian.",
   "agenda_item": "billing",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 13,
   "speaker": "Ian",
   "text": "We're moving forty-two thousand subscribers to the new billing system. The test run had one point two percent errors.",
   "agenda_item": "billing",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [
    "E009",
    "E010"
   ],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 14,
   "speaker": "Brooke",
   "text": "Half a percent is nothing. That's basically clean.",
   "agenda_item": "billing",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [
    "E011"
   ],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 15,
   "speaker": "Nadine",
   "text": "One percent of forty-two thousand is four hundred people charged wrong.",
   "agenda_item": "billing",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [
    "E012",
    "E013"
   ],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 16,
   "speaker": "Arturo",
   "text": "Can't we just refund anyone who complains?",
   "agenda_item": "billing",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [
    "E014"
   ],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 17,
   "speaker": "Ian",
   "text": "We can, but people who get double-charged at twelve ninety-nine don't complain. They cancel.",
   "agenda_item": "billing",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [
    "E015"
   ],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 18,
   "speaker": "Nadine",
   "text": "Our beta churn is already seven percent a month.",
   "agenda_item": "billing",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [
    "E016"
   ],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 19,
   "speaker": "Brooke",
   "text": "So what do you want, Ian?",
   "agenda_item": "billing",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [
    "E017"
   ],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 20,
   "speaker": "Ian",
   "text": "Launch the app on the sixth, but don't migrate billing until February. Run both systems for a month.",
   "agenda_item": "billing",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 21,
   "speaker": "Brooke",
   "text": "Two billing systems for a month. That's twice the work.",
   "agenda_item": "billing",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 22,
   "speaker": "Ian",
   "text": "It's twice the work instead of four hundred angry people.",
   "agenda_item": "billing",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 23,
   "speaker": "Brooke",
   "text": "Fine. Billing migrates in February. The app launches without it.",
   "agenda_item": "billing",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [
    "E018"
   ],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 24,
   "speaker": "Ian",
   "text": "Thank you. I'll keep both systems running and write the cutover plan for February.",
   "agenda_item": "billing",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [
    "E019"
   ],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 25,
   "speaker": "Nadine",
   "text": "It'd be nice if engineering looked over the help articles before launch, too.",
   "agenda_item": "billing",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [
    "E020"
   ],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 26,
   "speaker": "Arturo",
   "text": "The campaign. We have sixty thousand for influencers and the waitlist is at fifty thousand.",
   "agenda_item": "marketing",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [
    "E021",
    "E022"
   ],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 27,
   "speaker": "Brooke",
   "text": "Fifty thousand people waiting. That's the story.",
   "agenda_item": "marketing",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [
    "E023"
   ],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 28,
   "speaker": "Nadine",
   "text": "How many tickets are we expecting launch week?",
   "agenda_item": "marketing",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [
    "E024"
   ],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 29,
   "speaker": "Arturo",
   "text": "Our model says about four thousand.",
   "agenda_item": "marketing",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [
    "E025"
   ],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 30,
   "speaker": "Nadine",
   "text": "With twelve agents, that's over three hundred tickets each. In one week.",
   "agenda_item": "marketing",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [
    "E026"
   ],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 31,
   "speaker": "Ian",
   "text": "Twelve? I thought two people just left.",
   "agenda_item": "marketing",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [
    "E027"
   ],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 32,
   "speaker": "Nadine",
   "text": "They did. Sorry, I'm still counting them. Nine agents.",
   "agenda_item": "marketing",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [
    "E028"
   ],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 33,
   "speaker": "Brooke",
   "text": "Nine. Then we hire temps.",
   "agenda_item": "marketing",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [
    "E029"
   ],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 34,
   "speaker": "Arturo",
   "text": "I was on the slopes in Whistler last week and three people in the lift line had the app.",
   "agenda_item": "marketing",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [
    "E030"
   ],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 35,
   "speaker": "Brooke",
   "text": "In Whistler! That's the demographic.",
   "agenda_item": "marketing",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 36,
   "speaker": "Ian",
   "text": "Did you actually ski, or just count app users?",
   "agenda_item": "marketing",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 37,
   "speaker": "Nadine",
   "text": "Can we hire temps before the sixth?",
   "agenda_item": "marketing",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [
    "E031"
   ],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 38,
   "speaker": "Brooke",
   "text": "We can. I'll approve the budget for four temps today.",
   "agenda_item": "marketing",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [
    "E032"
   ],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 39,
   "speaker": "Ian",
   "text": "I just checked the waitlist dashboard. It's fifteen thousand, not fifty.",
   "agenda_item": "marketing",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [
    "E033"
   ],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 40,
   "speaker": "Arturo",
   "text": "Fifteen. I was looking at the email list.",
   "agenda_item": "marketing",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [
    "E034"
   ],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 41,
   "speaker": "Brooke",
   "text": "Fifteen is still great.",
   "agenda_item": "marketing",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [
    "E035"
   ],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 42,
   "speaker": "Arturo",
   "text": "Maybe we hold back half the influencer posts until week two, when support has caught up.",
   "agenda_item": "marketing",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [
    "E036"
   ],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 43,
   "speaker": "Nadine",
   "text": "That would help us a lot.",
   "agenda_item": "marketing",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 44,
   "speaker": "Brooke",
   "text": "Let's see how week one goes before we hold anything back.",
   "agenda_item": "marketing",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [
    "E037"
   ],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 45,
   "speaker": "Arturo",
   "text": "I've already signed three of the influencer contracts. They post on the sixth.",
   "agenda_item": "marketing",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 46,
   "speaker": "Ian",
   "text": "You signed contracts? Before this meeting?",
   "agenda_item": "marketing",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 47,
   "speaker": "Arturo",
   "text": "They were going to go to a competitor.",
   "agenda_item": "marketing",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 48,
   "speaker": "Brooke",
   "text": "The call. January sixth. Go.",
   "agenda_item": "call",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [
    "E038"
   ],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 49,
   "speaker": "Ian",
   "text": "Conditional go. The crash fix ships, and billing stays where it is.",
   "agenda_item": "call",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 50,
   "speaker": "Nadine",
   "text": "And the temps start before launch.",
   "agenda_item": "call",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 51,
   "speaker": "Brooke",
   "text": "Fine. Conditional go for January sixth: crash fix in, billing in February, temps by launch.",
   "agenda_item": "call",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [
    "E039",
    "E040"
   ],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 52,
   "speaker": "Nadine",
   "text": "Could someone tell the support team tonight, so they hear it from us first?",
   "agenda_item": "call",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [
    "E041"
   ],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 53,
   "speaker": "Ian",
   "text": "I'll write to them. They should hear it from the CTO.",
   "agenda_item": "call",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [
    "E042"
   ],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 54,
   "speaker": "Brooke",
   "text": "Is the App Store approval still valid for the new build?",
   "agenda_item": "call",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [
    "E043"
   ],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 55,
   "speaker": "Ian",
   "text": "The approval from the eighteenth covers this version. The crash fix needs a fast re-review.",
   "agenda_item": "call",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [
    "E044"
   ],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 56,
   "speaker": "Arturo",
   "text": "Who's telling investors that billing moved to February?",
   "agenda_item": "call",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [
    "E045"
   ],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 57,
   "speaker": "Brooke",
   "text": "Okay. We launch on the sixth. Good work, everyone.",
   "agenda_item": "call",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [],
   "interrupted": false
